							"left": 776,
							"top": 24,
							"width": 368,
							"height": 166,
							"text": "Microservices Architecture:\n– System is decomposed into independently deployable services.\n– Each service has its own database (no shared DB).\n– Communication between services is done via REST through an API Gateway.\n– Each service encapsulates a distinct domain: Pet profiles, care tasks, notifications.\n– Enables independent scaling, deployment, and failure isolation.\n"
						}
