							"top": 16,
							"width": 328,
							"height": 154,
							"text": "Microservices Deployment:\n– Each service runs in its own container or server instance.\n– API Gateway is the single entry point for client requests.\n– Services communicate over internal REST calls.\n– Databases are isolated, following the \"Database per Service\" pattern.\n– Enables horizontal scaling of individual services based on load.\n"
						}
